# 📊 User Login Activity Dataset
A comprehensive record of user authentication logs, including login timestamps, IP addresses, account status, and profile metadata.

## 📁 Dataset Overview
This repository contains a structured dataset of user activities. The data focuses on tracking login patterns and account health.


| Feature | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Account Status** | Boolean indicating if the account is currently active. |
| **Login Metadata** | Precise timestamps and source IP addresses. |
| **User Profiles** | Unique usernames and hashed/masked passwords. |
| **Activity Tracking** | Calculation of months since last login and 4-year inactivity flags. |

