## 🛠️ Data Structure
The dataset is organized with the following columns:
*   `account_active`: (Boolean) Status of the user account.
*   `last_login_date`: (Timestamp) The last recorded entry.
*   `user_name`: (String) Unique identifier for the user.
*   `months_since_last_login`: (Integer) Time elapsed since the last session.
*   `profile_picture`: (URL) Link to the user's hosted avatar.

